sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant DEV as eSSL or ZKTeco terminal
    participant EP as Tenant-scoped ADMS ingest endpoint
    participant SEC as Serial and secret check
    participant ING as Idempotent ingest
    participant MAP as Device user to employee map
    participant WL as Exceptions worklist
    participant ATT as Attendance rules in section 09

    Note over DEV,EP: Setup - admin enters the tenant endpoint and secret in the device cloud settings once
    Note over DEV,EP: Endpoint paths and packet fields come from the vendor protocol docs at the V-11 bench test, not from this PRD
    DEV->>EP: Handshake with device serial
    EP->>SEC: Validate serial and secret against the tenant
    alt Unknown serial or no secret match
        SEC-->>DEV: Reject and log a security event, AC-DEV-5
    else Registered
        SEC-->>EP: OK, serial resolved to tenant and location
        EP->>DEV: Queue user-sync commands on the command poll
    end

    Note over DEV: Device offline 6h across a shift change, buffers 214 punches
    DEV->>EP: Attendance-log upload with 214 punches
    Note right of DEV: No ACK in time, device retries the upload twice
    DEV->>EP: Attendance-log upload again, same records
    EP->>ING: Punch records with serial, device user, timestamp, direction
    ING->>ING: Dedup on serial, device user, timestamp, direction and payload hash

    ING->>MAP: Resolve device user to employee
    alt Mapped
        MAP->>ATT: Attribute punch, derive IN and OUT, OT, LOP
    else Unmapped, users 00042 and 00119
        MAP->>WL: Hold punch, exclude from LOP and OT until an admin maps it, AC-DEV-3
    end
    EP-->>DEV: ACK so the device marks records delivered
    Note over ING,ATT: Result - 212 attributed, 2 held, 0 duplicated, 0 dropped

    Note over DEV,ATT: Device down or unsupported - fall back to web or mobile check-in, bulk CSV, manual muster. Never blocks payroll
